  m_text: 'Pongon and Shibbi are going on vacation to Mt. Fuji, Japan.

    during
    a train ride there, they are BORED!!!!!

    so they sync up their minds with
    a cable, and run Shingonware.EXE to kill some time!


    press [ESC] to start....
    :)'
